ble until it has taken 9 damage</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Have you every tried to manipulate one of them? Just finding them is hard enough. Mostly you attack and hope it breaks.</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This isn&#39;t a big change, but it does stop some shenanigans. Tempest and Omni forcing Ambuscade to flip to his front side with the cloak out for example. But it also means he can hide out during the End of Days and other things. Not too much of a difficulty increase overall.</p>",
