        "raw": "I agree Amby needs a bit of souping-up, and I really love the &quot;incap one hero for a win&quot; idea, but adding both that AND replacement of traps is probably overkill.&nbsp; Personally I don&#39;t really like the trap mechanic at all, it feels very gimmicky.&nbsp; (I do like the cards on a conceptual basis; besides being a transparent Kraven the Hunter ripoff, &#39;Cade also has the powers of Gambit!)&nbsp; And it always bugs me that you can attack his cloaking device, which is way too fragile to protect him for any length of time...him Vanishing is just a nuisance.&nbsp; Also his advanced text on cloaked side is irrelevant in many games, unless you have someone like Bunker or Scholar in the game.&nbsp; And it&#39;s very weird that he can hurt himself with Charged Attacks.\n\n[quote=\"brytehfryguy\"]\n(NO! Stop eating my cloaking device, Haka!)\n[/quote]\n\nNeeds more salt.\n",
