        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-30T21:42:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>though I haven't played it I'd say Spiff's version looks sound, gonna try it when I play again.</p><p>Another thing I liked (someone posted it somwhere and I tried it) was instead of putting the trap card face up rotating it 180 degrees (and having all the other cards vertically aligned) so when you are shuffling it's easier to avoid not looking at it.</p>",
